 e Campo Comprido proporciona mobilidade e conveniência para a rotina.\n\nAgende sua visita e conheça pessoalmente este apartamento.\n\nValores e disponibilidade sujeitos a alteração sem aviso prévio. Consulte nossos corretores.\n\n#Apartamento #Curitiba #Ecoville #EdificioMadri #ApartamentoEcoville #DoisQuartos #VarandaGourmet #CondominioClube #ImoveisCuritiba #MyBrokerImoveis25:[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"details\":{\"id\":\"4483ea79-5905-4057-b1ee-84a515fba6f","fotos":["https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150453/FOIM%200004-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150457/FOIM%200010-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150457/FOIM%200009-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150457/FOIM%200008-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150453/FOIM%200011-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150453/FOIM%200003-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150555/FOIM%200001-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150556/FOIM%200002-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150453/FOIM%200006-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150508/FOIM%200014-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150506/FOIM%200015-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261016150511/FOIM%200019-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/